{"id":"dano","lemma":"dano","pos":"noun","rank":1451,"glosses":["damage (an instance or the state of being damaged)","injury (violation of a person, their character, feelings, rights, property, or interests)","damage (a measure of how many hitpoints a weapon or unit can deal or take)"],"ipa":"/ˈdɐ.nu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"danos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-dano.wav","examples":[{"text":"Não houve danos.","en":"There was no damage.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},null]},{"text":"Vamos ver se há algum dano.","en":"Let's see if there's any damage.","words":[{"g":"let's go"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"some, any"},null]},{"text":"O dano está feito.","en":"The damage is done.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"like"}]},{"text":"O dano foi mínimo.","en":"The damage was minimal.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"minimum"}]},{"text":"Eu paguei pelos danos.","en":"I paid for the damage.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535427","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to give [someone] money…","l":"pagar"},null,null]}]}